# Loaded by `vite` / `npm run dev` only. Not used by Pi-hosted Consul.
#
# Optional laptop git mirror after Durable Set Limits. Leave unset unless you
# run `just limit-sync-serve` and want Apply to write this checkout.
# Pi-hosted save does not need this — gateway Durable Apply is the SoT.
# VITE_LIMIT_SYNC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8790
